== Section 1 __NOEDITSECTION__ ==
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-section1">
<div class="mw-collapsible-content"> 
<blockquote>Grandpapa blowed a hole in the flame. He said I must try to sleep. But I was scared and I couldn't, not with the great purple howl, and the shuffling of the beetles, and the endless night, and the din of the children swimming above and around us.</blockquote><blockquote>"Our new home will prevail. We have all we need. Just have to hold out young 'un, and wait for the storm to end."</blockquote><blockquote>"Tell me a story," I said.</blockquote><blockquote>"It's time for sleep," he said. I folded my arms crossly, and he knew I'd not let up until he gave me a story.</blockquote><blockquote>"Oh alright."</blockquote><blockquote>"The one about the armies!"</blockquote><blockquote>"Ah, yes."</blockquote><blockquote>Then he put his arm around me, and knelt beside my splintery bed.</blockquote>
</div>
</div>

